%% Proposed architecture; not deployed in Phase 1
flowchart TD
 Local[Local checks] --> Persistent[Approve bootstrap persistent state and ECR]
 Persistent --> Plan[Demo core plan and cost review]
 Plan --> Approval[Explicit apply approval]
 Approval --> Core[Network EKS RDS queue]
 Core --> Workloads[Images controller workloads internal ALB]
 Workloads --> Edge[Approved gateway edge plan and apply]
 Edge --> Migrate[Migrate seed and configure Amplify]
 Migrate --> Verify[Verify and capture evidence]
 Verify --> DestroyPlan[Show destruction plan and target]
 DestroyPlan --> DestroyApproval[Explicit destroy approval]
 DestroyApproval --> Remove[Detach gateway and delete LB workloads]
 Remove --> Wait[Wait for ALB and ENI deletion]
 Wait --> Destroy[Destroy demo core]
 Destroy --> Audit[Audit residual resources and costs]
 Audit --> Persistent
